<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 25.9250 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 25.9250 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate (TIIE) rose by 81.5 basis points to 25.9250 percent on Wednesday, from 25.11 percent on Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>THE TIIP rose 20.62 basis points to 25.9533 percent on Wednesday from 25.7471 percent the week before.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558</p>
</text>
